'''Prism '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "PR1SM". It is now only obtainable through trading as the code has since expired. 

== Appearance ==
Prism is painted in white. However, the blade of the Prism has some geometrical shapes in grey.

== Trivia ==
* Like every other in-game [[Codes|code]], this [[Codes|code]] has expired.
* Like the knife [[JD]], it has a slight resemblance to the [[Sparkle Time Pack|Sparkle Time]] knives, specifically [[Sparkle9]].

